        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ANNSIM-THEOREMS-11-15-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-THEOREMS-11-15-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH11-KIRCHHOFF-FLUX-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH12-NEYMAN-PEARSON-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH13-LEED-EUI-BOUND-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH14-SANDBOX-MEM-SAFE-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH15-LOG-DAT-BIN-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-THEOREMS-11-15-WITNESS   PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-THEOREMS-11-15.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-THEOREMS-11-15.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH11-KIRCHHOFF-FLUX-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH12-NEYMAN-PEARSON-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH13-LEED-EUI-BOUND-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH14-SANDBOX-MEM-SAFE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH15-LOG-DAT-BIN-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-THEOREMS-11-15-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-THEOREMS-11-15-WITNESS.
